  <section class="individual text-left pb-3 pt-5">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;" class="long-title">
            <h3 class="centered">As A <span class="archetype">Member</span>, These Are Your <span class="text-orange">Hidden Qualities, Unknown Tendencies,<br>And Positive Attributes</span> That You Wouldn't Expect</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-4">
              <img src="../assets/images/abilities.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <p>As a Member, you tend to keep things to yourself. Though on the surface you seem isolated, you however have a peculiar ear for other people’s concerns. You won’t go so far as to talk to others yourself, but you will notice if there’s anything wrong and act on that basis. This makes you a crucial part of other people’s lives, as you are the steward who can tell things exactly as they are.</p>
              <p>The Members are centered around the idea that they do not exclusively roam the world. There are people in every corner, providing inspiration and love to those around them. For this reason, therefore, you also <span class="text-orange">possess the mentality of the “we.”</span> You center yourself and your philosophy around the common good, and much happiness is attained from this because you become wiser to everyone’s needs.</p>
              <p>Another trait that is so typically yours is your intuition. You are the sort of person who attacks a problem through angles that others would not expect, instead of relying purely on logic. Your heart is also the very thing that pushes you to help your teammates instead of yourself, as well as being there for your family and friends, who all need your help in some way.</p>

            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Now, despite your strong sense of intuition, you are a remarkably calm person. More than this, you are a healing force around people. You give them strength by reassuring them and being <span class="text-orange">gentle in your treatment</span> of them. No matter how harsh the situation gets, the fact that you are in the team means that you are going to end up inspiring others one way or another.</p>
          <p>That being said, there’s more about your potential than you understand at this juncture, <span class="username"></span>.</p>
          <p>With your hidden qualities in full view, it is time for you to know what your strengths are and how you can better use them...</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
