  <section class="individual bg-darkblue pb-3 pt-5" id="step2">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12">
          <div class="title-container">
            <img src="https://individualogist.com/soul-flame-tarot/assets/img/title-bg-v2.png" alt="Snow" style="width:100%;" class="long-title">
            <h3 class="centered">As A Member, These Are Your <span class="text-orange">Hidden Strengths And<br>Positive Attributes</span> That You Wouldn't Expect</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-sm-4 order-sm-2">
              <img src="../assets/images/abilities-2.png" style="width: 100%;">
            </div>
            <div class="col-sm-8">
              <p>Being a Member, you are prudent. You understand the reality that each person has their own individual identity. Being an introvert yourself, you know what it means to be <span class="text-orange">strongly connected to one’s own self</span>. And because of such, you remain to be prudent on how you approach others, knowing that your goals might not be necessarily aligned with them. </p>
              <p>Because of this prudence, you will gain the respect of those around you. Instead of engulfing their own personal space, you retain an appropriate distance to them. Just as how everyone wants to have their own circle, you know that respecting such is crucial in maintaining a meaningful relationship. </p>
              <p>As such, you <span class="text-orange">avoid unnecessary conflict</span>. While you are an introvert who loves to work for a common goal, such prudence allows you to do so without sewing division within the group. And for this, people will appreciate your presence, as you are that person whom they’ll be comfortable to hang-out with. </p>
              <p>Furthermore, seeing the importance of the bigger whole, you understand the value of interconnectedness. Much like in eastern thought, you perceive things and its relational value to the greater whole. </p>

            </div>
          </div>
          <p>With this, you tend to become cooperative towards those you share a goal with. Because of your we-centeredness, you know how important it is to promote a culture of respect and mutuality. By taking the first step, you seek to inspire others and move them towards the path of love and reciprocity</p>
          <p>Moreover, you often do this by <span class="text-orange">sharing your time, talents, and treasures</span> with those that you care the most. Without hesitation, you’ll spend most of your time with them as you seek to explore the various facets of life. Regardless of the situation, you’ll make it through by integrating yourself with your partner and achieving a unified existence. </p>
          <p>With your intuitive nature, you are adaptable. Just like the famous quote by Bruce Lee, you can become like water. Thus, you can fit any container for you are formless. Since you understand life and its many branches, you know for a fact that it is never okay to contain yourself in one. </p>
          <p>Using your intuitive approach, you touch on many aspects. Whether it is a range of soft skills or ways to communicate with others, you are a jack-of-all-trades. Regardless of the situation you’re in, such crafty trait allows you to find that silver lining. </p>
          <p>Thus, when dealing with others, you know communicate with people from all walks of life. You never limit yourself in your own viewpoints. Instead, you welcome a person for who they are, including their contexts in life. </p>
          <p>Finally, with the quality of calmness, <span class="text-orange">being decisive is out of the question</span>. When you want something, you will go for it...no questions asked. Like an arrow that’s fired straight to the target, your decisiveness allows you to achieve that laser-focused precision towards your goal in life. </p>
          <p>Given your strengths, you can assess things without the need of external validation. Although you tend to work with teams and pursue a common goal, your individual assessment remains pure and untainted, as long as you remain calm. Because your archetype tends to be swayed due to how strong your we-centeredness is, this calm decisiveness allows you to keep the scales balanced. </p>
          <p>Thus, when deciding, remember to tap onto this strength. Don’t rely solely on your cooperative abilities. Instead, remember that being a member also means that you are an individual. </p>
          <p>Now that you’re acquainted with your strengths, dear <span class="username"></span>, it is time for you to know how you can exercise them in various aspects of your life. </p>
          <p>For now, let’s start with one that strikes a chord: your romantic relationships.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
          <a class="btn btn-outline-success btn-2" id="nav-btn2" onclick="nextReading(2,3)">Show Me Now</a>
        </div>
